            {
                "entry_id": "f2370fe3-ce75-374d-83bb-a717367ea686",
                "word": "edgelord",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "714a6d86-715a-4aec-b5fa-ea69591a0f5d",
                        "entry_id": "f2370fe3-ce75-374d-83bb-a717367ea686",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "edgelords"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfd6d963-789f-355a-b2c1-c9a205b45d66",
                        "entry_id": "f2370fe3-ce75-374d-83bb-a717367ea686",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Individu adoptant une attitude et des discours perçus comme excentriques, voire choquants, dans le but de se démarquer, d’attirer l’attention."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cd7d496-c5cf-4c67-8a51-5b7b7e6f23b2",
                                "sense_id": "bfd6d963-789f-355a-b2c1-c9a205b45d66",
                                "text": "Bon, entre-temps, le milliardaire américain s'est reconverti dans une carrière de edgelord en étalant ses 12 ans d'âge mental sur Twitter, mais ça n'est pas grave."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "011180e9-2742-4446-b043-934d9aace0f0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2370fe3-ce75-374d-83bb-a717367ea686",
                        "source_sense_id": "bfd6d963-789f-355a-b2c1-c9a205b45d66",
                        "target_lang_word": "edgelord",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "edgelord",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                        "entry_id": "2986a036-6655-3616-9f29-159aa67fdeb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who tries to appear edgy by doing or saying provocative, controversial, taboo, or offensive things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "mildly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "131fcf38-7d19-4fb7-9a95-e5cf0f863609",
                                                "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                                "text": "Given that I have a certain personality that draws in a certain type of person, I have a ton of people on my feed who are Wiccan, Pagan, Satanist or some other kind of fringe religion or cult member. […] They make extra sure to remind you that they never take down their Halloween decorations, because, in the dark, black heart of an edgelord, every day is Halloween."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0956f9d7-4dea-401d-ad1b-974b070c8a4c",
                                                "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                                "text": "But the joke, in the end, is that there is no joke. The sensibility of the edgelord—who pushes the boundaries of offensive humor—is really one long tumble into the abyss."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b924bb5f-5be5-4ac3-92da-5df1f0315c29",
                                                "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                                "text": "[Felix] Kjellberg knew plenty of edgelords — he was a gamer, after all — but he never considered himself one of them. Sure, he cursed and shouted while playing video games, but that was normal behavior."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da2f5674-d4b3-412d-b96d-08126ab5270f",
                                                "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                                "text": "This is the man who aspires to save our planet and get us a new one to inhabit: clown, genius, edgelord, visionary, industrialist, showman, cad[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66e40752-8807-44ae-b376-7baade508d86",
                                                "sense_id": "5abc7ccc-3d75-3a56-b23e-ff7ae0d79dd1",
                                                "text": "The good thing about the music industry being so against this is that it seems pretty easy to strike things down. But I also think it’s good for there to be one edgelord moment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "edgelord",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c5e0d13-2fc4-3318-8203-a29d60bc2bc6",
                                        "entry_id": "9807abcb-4b15-3672-aef6-6115d3ffdb30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To behave like an edgelord; to provoke with risque behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "mildly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "545f42d2-1c93-465d-8fdf-767be21d2463",
                                                "sense_id": "8c5e0d13-2fc4-3318-8203-a29d60bc2bc6",
                                                "text": "The Crimson doesn't name any names, probably because no one wants to be known as the kid who almost went to Harvard except they edgelorded too hard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42201b3a-4a4f-4828-afe8-6b29c6e4b968",
                                                "sense_id": "8c5e0d13-2fc4-3318-8203-a29d60bc2bc6",
                                                "text": "Logan is a great example of the false depth that comes from denying morals just for the sake of edgelording."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "509fe2ae-3f4f-4bd7-b1f8-1ca9a29dc3e2",
                                                "sense_id": "8c5e0d13-2fc4-3318-8203-a29d60bc2bc6",
                                                "text": "I have personally used and enjoyed the Perl language for nearly 30 years, and it's distressing to see the bigotry and edgelording coming from prominent elements of the community—not to mention the board's failures to respond decisively."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
